  {
   "id": "t1207876797",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 536,
   "width": 877.2500000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1481770425,
   "versionNonce": 1467040793,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Same total work in all three cost cases \u2014 200,000 increments \u2014 so only the contention differs, which is what makes the syscall counts comparable.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Same total work in all three cost cases \u2014 200,000 increments \u2014 so only the contention differs, which is what makes the syscall counts comparable.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1849645370",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 560,
   "width": 859.1,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 472723429,
   "versionNonce": 1922547739,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An uncontended std::mutex costs no syscalls at all. What costs is contention: identical work, two orders of magnitude more kernel involvement.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "An uncontended std::mutex costs no syscalls at all. What costs is contention: identical work, two orders of magnitude more kernel involvement.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t776068985",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 584,
   "width": 816.7500000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 889946580,
   "versionNonce": 1866458483,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Counted from outside with strace -f -c -e trace=futex. Nothing here is a duration; only the SIGN of the comparison is gated (see ch39).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Counted from outside with strace -f -c -e trace=futex. Nothing here is a duration; only the SIGN of the comparison is gated (see ch39).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
